   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "README",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "KREA 2 STORE RESTAGE  -  one reference photo of your model,\nany new image of them: different clothes, angles, scenes.\n\nIdentity Edit v1.2 keeps the face; Realistic Snapshot adds the\nsmartphone / natural-photo look. Both LoRAs are ON.\n\nModes:\n  A) Prompt only (group 2 bypassed): describe outfit, pose,\n     camera angle, scene. The face and hair stay.\n  B) Try-on (enable group 2): load a product photo of the\n     garment as image 2 and use the try-on prompt.\n\nTested 2026-09-14: outfit change in a store 12 s, side-profile\nangle change 9 s, cardigan try-on 19 s (1 MP)."
   ],
   "color": "#232",
   "bgcolor": "#353"
  },
  {
   "id": 107,
   "type": "Note",
